#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:2 f91403a8d1304d1ebb3c738f5fe29e38
msgid "Gunicorn"
msgstr "Gunicorn"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:4 ec0194ff703c4daaa2d4ac6652951968
msgid ""
"`Gunicorn`_ is a pure Python WSGI server with simple configuration and "
"multiple worker implementations for performance tuning."
msgstr "`Gunicorn`_ 是一个纯 Python 实现的 WSGI 服务器，配置简单，提供多种 worker "
"实现以进行性能调优。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:7 99ba272c718046d5b1284c5c421ad16f
msgid "It tends to integrate easily with hosting platforms."
msgstr "通常可以很容易地集成到各种托管平台中。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:8 4760fcd10cfe4a5f83b6c10dbf30656c
msgid "It does not support Windows (but does run on WSL)."
msgstr "不支持 Windows（但可运行在 WSL 上）。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:9 ecfa6d92bc9847f78c0308692944cda4
msgid ""
"It is easy to install as it does not require additional dependencies or "
"compilation."
msgstr "安装便捷，无需额外依赖或编译过程。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:11
#: f804f5c687364af59a201c724cad505c
msgid "It has built-in async worker support using gevent or eventlet."
msgstr "内置对 gevent 和 eventlet 的异步 worker 支持。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:13
#: 7fed4d4c9c2f4a11b388c0992c783fac
msgid ""
"This page outlines the basics of running Gunicorn. Be sure to read its "
"`documentation`_ and use ``gunicorn --help`` to understand what features "
"are available."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍了运行 Gunicorn 的基础内容。请务必阅读其 `documentation`_，并使用 `"
"gunicorn --help` 查看可用功能。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:22
#: 0fcb800a0d634a2f89829caff15dec3a
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:24
#: b7c6ff6c18a84732bba645b1c3c6446b
msgid ""
"Gunicorn is easy to install, as it does not require external dependencies"
" or compilation. It runs on Windows only under WSL."
msgstr "Gunicorn 安装非常简单，无需外部依赖或编译。它仅在 WSL 上支持 Windows。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:27
#: ec4bed65ae2247bba9a1dc92d7667be8
msgid "Create a virtualenv, install your application, then install ``gunicorn``."
msgstr "创建一个虚拟环境，安装你的应用，然后安装 ``gunicorn``。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:40
#: 378afde2c9aa42289554d9242130d3b4
msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:42
#: 6f030826e43e4414b7d32faf8c3d587f
msgid ""
"The only required argument to Gunicorn tells it how to load your Flask "
"application. The syntax is ``{module_import}:{app_variable}``. "
"``module_import`` is the dotted import name to the module with your "
"application. ``app_variable`` is the variable with the application. It "
"can also be a function call (with any arguments) if you're using the app "
"factory pattern."
msgstr ""
"使用 Gunicorn 运行 Flask 应用时，只需要一个参数，指定如何加载你的 Flask "
"应用。语法为 ``{module_import}:{app_variable}``。其中 ``module_import`` "
"是指向应用模块的导入路径，``app_variable`` "
"是应用实例的变量名。如果使用的是工厂函数模式，也可以传入函数调用（包含参数）"
"。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:65
#: 567f42aeb7254e1b8090d2ab6e3834d4
msgid ""
"The ``-w`` option specifies the number of processes to run; a starting "
"value could be ``CPU * 2``. The default is only 1 worker, which is "
"probably not what you want for the default worker type."
msgstr ""
"``-w`` 选项用于指定要运行的进程数量；一个推荐的初始值是 ``CPU * 2``。"
"默认只有 1 个 worker，这对于默认的 worker 类型来说可能不够。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:69
#: 9a2a7fbee2d04ec6a646878f8ac030cd
msgid ""
"Logs for each request aren't shown by default, only worker info and "
"errors are shown. To show access logs on stdout, use the ``--access-"
"logfile=-`` option."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下不会显示每个请求的日志，只会显示 worker 信息和错误。"
"若要将访问日志输出到 stdout，使用 ``--access-logfile=-`` 选项。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:75
#: 081a5aed0e4543959f91b8e39bdea330
msgid "Binding Externally"
msgstr "外部绑定"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:77
#: 8a63da8147284a2c88caf720c9c2d1b7
msgid ""
"Gunicorn should not be run as root because it would cause your "
"application code to run as root, which is not secure. However, this means"
" it will not be possible to bind to port 80 or 443. Instead, a reverse "
"proxy such as :doc:`nginx` or :doc:`apache-httpd` should be used in front"
" of Gunicorn."
msgstr ""
"不建议以 root 身份运行 Gunicorn，因为这会导致应用代码也以 root "
"身份运行，存在安全隐患。然而，这也意味着无法绑定到 80 或 443 端口。此时应在 "
"Gunicorn 前使用诸如 :doc:`nginx` 或 :doc:`apache-httpd` 的反向代理服务器。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:83
#: 8692be8b62fb4fdaaadf7823da001107
msgid ""
"You can bind to all external IPs on a non-privileged port using the ``-b "
"0.0.0.0`` option. Don't do this when using a reverse proxy setup, "
"otherwise it will be possible to bypass the proxy."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用 ``-b 0.0.0.0`` 选项将服务器绑定到所有外部 IP "
"上的非特权端口。但在使用反向代理的设置中不要这样做，否则可能绕过代理访问服务"
"。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:92
#: 5e4eb3866e724558946e0638b5c83490
msgid ""
"``0.0.0.0`` is not a valid address to navigate to, you'd use a specific "
"IP address in your browser."
msgstr "注意：``0.0.0.0`` 不是一个可以在浏览器中访问的有效地址，浏览器中应使用具体的 "
"IP 地址。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:97
#: 30db3a9e96064b6cb36dae0b06d8fdf2
msgid "Async with gevent or eventlet"
msgstr "异步支持：gevent 或 eventlet"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:99
#: 36cde87f56b44fc4b4f86e41741f3de5
msgid ""
"The default sync worker is appropriate for many use cases. If you need "
"asynchronous support, Gunicorn provides workers using either `gevent`_ or"
" `eventlet`_. This is not the same as Python's ``async/await``, or the "
"ASGI server spec. You must actually use gevent/eventlet in your own code "
"to see any benefit to using the workers."
msgstr ""
"默认的同步 worker 适用于大多数场景。如果你需要异步支持，Gunicorn 提供了使用 "
"`gevent`_ 或 `eventlet`_ 的 worker。这与 Python 的 ``async/await`` 或 ASGI "
"服务器规范不同。你必须在自己的代码中实际使用 gevent 或 eventlet，"
"才能真正发挥这些 worker 的优势。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/gunicorn.rst:105
#: a15f2d5b611b4272ab56e4da537886e3
msgid ""
"When using either gevent or eventlet, greenlet>=1.0 is required, "
"otherwise context locals such as ``request`` will not work as expected. "
"When using PyPy, PyPy>=7.3.7 is required."
msgstr ""
"当使用 gevent 或 eventlet 时，必须使用 greenlet>=1.0，否则像 ``request`` "
"这样的上下文局部变量将无法按预期工作。 如果使用 PyPy，则要求 PyPy 版本不低于 "
"7.3.7。"

